{
  "model": "api.para",
  "pk": 1,
  "fields": {
    "slug": "welcome_note",
    "body": "Welcome! I'm just someone who enjoys turning ideas into code and learning something new with every project. This portfolio is where I share what I build, what I learn, and the progress I'm making as a developer."
  }
},
{
  "model": "api.para",
  "pk": 2,
  "fields": {
    "slug": "welcome_intro",
    "body": "This isn't just a portfolio—it's a place where I share what I build and what I learn. You guys can browse my projects, explore reusable code snippets, leave comments, give notes, and be part of my journey as I continue growing as a developer."
  }
},
{
  "model": "api.para",
  "pk": 3,
  "fields": {
    "slug": "reason_intro",
    "body": "I built this platform for more than one reason—to sharpen my skills, share reusable code snippets, document my progress, create a space where others can explore my work, and add a solid real-world project to my portfolio. Every feature here has been built as part of my learning journey."
  }
},
{
  "model": "api.para",
  "pk": 4,
  "fields": {
    "slug": "reason_practise",
    "body": "Every feature on this website is a chance to practice real-world development—from authentication and APIs to UI design, databases, and user interactions. Instead of building small demos, I learn by building something people can actually use."
  }
},
{
  "model": "api.para",
  "pk": 5,
  "fields": {
    "slug": "reason_show",
    "body": "This platform lets me organize and share my code snippets in one place, making it easy for others to explore my work, learn from it, or simply see how I approach different problems."
  }
},
{
  "model": "api.para",
  "pk": 6,
  "fields": {
    "slug": "reason_real-project",
    "body": "Instead of building another small demo, I wanted to create a complete, real-world project. It challenged me to work with authentication, databases, APIs, user interactions, and everything that goes into building a practical web application."
  }
},
{
  "model": "api.para",
  "pk": 7,
